Simulator::Cell::Bite=0x00E7B0A0 ; verified cdecl bool(u32 attackerIdx, u32 victimIdx, void* ev+0x48, u32* dir ev+0x54, int ev+0x38, float dt), plain ret (only caller 0xE7B540, the timed callback of an interaction event of kind 10, pushes 6, add esp,0x18). Sets +0x178 = 1 on both; victim less than 3 levels bigger (GetScaleDifferenceWithPlayer < 3): DamageCell(victim, attacker, -dir, 4, ...) when the damage is below its hp, else BreakOrSwallow(victim, attacker, dt); bigger victims: DamageCell and a push. Same address as GOG 2016 (docs/re/cell.md 3)
