Simulator::Cell::EatChunkA=0x00E7DD90 ; verified cdecl void(u32 eaterIdx, u32 victimIdx, u32 ev+0x30, u32 ev+0x3C, float dt), plain ret (only caller: event dispatcher 0xE7E130 case 0x13 at E7E28B pushes 5, add esp,0x14). A mouth bites a chunk off a creature: OnEat 0xE7D760 for the eater, victim hp(+0x244) -= GetDamageAmount(eater, victim) (clamped at 0, no DamageCell), attacker rest 0xE576F0, KillIfDead 0xE7A770(victim, eater, eaterRes, eater==avatar, 6, dt), push impulses 0xE72530 on both; health ring when the avatar is involved. Same address as GOG 2016 (docs/re/cell.md 3)
